\f0\b\fs32 \cf0 \ul \ulc0 Teaching:\
\pard\pardeftab720\ri-5\sl400\partightenfactor0

\f3\i\b0\fs28 \cf0 \ulnone \

\f4\b \ul PERCUSSION FOR SINGERS - Group workshops and 1:1 classes (online and in person)\
\

\f3\b0 \ulnone Mishka has always been passionate and curious about percussion and feels that rhythm is essential to singing, whether we play a percussive instrument or not. Connecting to groove and time while we sing can elevate a vocal performance and unites us with the music and the musicians we are playing with. It is part of what makes a singer a musician. In her shows she almost always plays percussion to accompany her songs, and has also many times been a side-woman on percussion and backing vocals.\
Each course and class varies slightly depending on the needs and interests of the participants, but some of what you'll be doing includes this:\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\ri-5\sl259\slmult1\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f5\i0 \cf0 \'95 Learning and playing a variety of grooves and styles\
\'95 Moving in time while singing and playing\
\'95 Understanding and feeling different types of "swing" and rhythmic subdivisions\
\'95 Making the most of handheld percussion (and household objects!) to accompany your songs\
\'95 Trying out songs from your own repertoire within the group\
To find out the next course dates or book a 1:1 class, send a message HERE\
Check out the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/@Perc"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 PERCUSSION FOR SINGERS Youtube}} for tutorials and to see what a workshop might be like!\
\

\f6\b \ul VOICE LESSONS 1:1 (online and in person)\

\f5\b0 \ulnone No two journeys are the same for any singer, we all have specific needs and interests, different goals and different abilities. Mishka works with singers of all levels, from helping beginners find their voice, musicians who want to start singing, to professional singers looking for coaching and accompaniment in their career. In the classes, what you\'92ll work on can include any or all of these things, depending on what you need and what you\'92re looking for:\
